  - ACADEMIC: Edith Fowke (York University), "The Tale of Anson Minor: An Ontario Camp Legend," Ethnologies 3:1, 1981, pp. 3-15. Multiple versions. Camps: Camp White Pine, Camp Kadimah, others. Origins traced to Dunnville, Ontario area.
